          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of 5 orange and white glowing points that appear and disappear in the sky: observation of several commercial airplanes approaching or taking off from Roissy-CDG.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "65559cd329815fe02ec847d8427df5159e0a1e821645082dfecc71c3d4b26014"
